Inline Common DualCredit
    documentation "This common stores details about the dual credit type and information about the organization that delivers the educational service and award."
    bool DualCreditIndicator
        documentation "Indicates whether the student assigned to the section is to receive dual credit upon successful completion."
        is optional
    descriptor DualCreditType
        documentation "For a student taking a dual credit course in a college or high school setting, indicates the type of dual credit program."
        is optional
    bool DualHighSchoolCreditIndicator
        documentation "Indicates whether successful completion of the course will result in credits toward high school graduation."
        is optional
    domain entity EducationOrganization
        documentation "The education organization reference that is awarding the postsecondary credit as part of the dual credit program. Use of this attribute requires that education organization, typically a postsecondary institution, is a defined education organization."
        is optional
        role name DualCredit
    descriptor DualCreditInstitution
        documentation "Descriptor for the postsecondary institution offering college credit. This descriptor may be used to select a postsecondary institution that is not defined as an education organization, and/or select a general type of postsecondary institution."
        is optional